WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
[Soft instrumental music]
A little light. Meet Lantern.

00:04.000 --> 00:09.000
For the everyday.
A small AI, imagined for family life.

00:09.000 --> 00:14.000
The little things, remembered.
Tomorrow: library books.

00:14.000 --> 00:20.000
A nudge. Never a decision.
Send a reminder? Only when you say so.

00:20.000 --> 00:25.000
More room for being together.
Less to carry into the evening.

00:25.000 --> 00:30.000
Lantern. A little light for your day.
[Music gently fades]
